{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>ויבא</b> — The sense of <b>בן אדם</b> is because he is in the vision's appearance among the holy angels, and so too Ezekiel the prophet." "<b>ויאמר אלי הבן</b> — Your soul is בן אדם, or your heart." "And the sense of <b>כי לעת קץ</b> — to a distant end, like אנשי מדות."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:28.818477413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}